      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Queensland%2C_Maryland"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Queensland shares borders with Westphalia, Marlboro Village, and Brock Hall to the north, Croom southeast, Marlton south, and Rosaryville southwest.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Queensland%2C_Maryland"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Residents fall under Marlton Elementary and Melwood Elementary for primary education, and James Madison Middle School for middle grades.",
